+    """
+    Normalizes a header field value received from the wire, as RFC 9110 and
+    RFC 9112 require:
+
+    * each obsolete line folding (obs-fold) is replaced with a single SP,
+    * CR, LF, NUL and other control characters (except HTAB), which can't be
+      part of a field value, are replaced with SP,
+    * leading and trailing whitespace is removed.
